---
import Frame from '../../../components/eq/Frame.astro';
import { data } from '../../../data/eq-data';
---
<Frame title="Personas & prompts"><h1>Personas & prompts</h1><p class="lede">The {data.personas} scenarios in this run. Read the opening message, the tested model's initial instructions, and the simulated person's role.</p><p class="notice">The tested model sees its own instructions and the opening message. The simulator's instructions include hidden persona information that the tested model does not receive. Prompts below are reconstructed from the run's upstream templates; private reasoning and conversation state are not shown.</p><ul>{data.persona_cards.map(p=><li><a href={`#${p.id}`}>{p.title}</a></li>)}</ul>{data.persona_cards.map(p=><section class="panel" id={p.id}><h2>{p.title}</h2><h3>Opening message</h3><p class="prompt-text">{p.opening}</p><details><summary>Tested model's initial instructions</summary><pre>{p.tested_prompt}</pre></details><details><summary>Simulated person's instructions (hidden from the tested model)</summary><pre>{p.persona_prompt}</pre></details><h3>Conversations for this persona</h3><ul>{data.conversations.filter(c=>c.scenario_id===p.id).map(c=><li><a href={`/eq/conversations/${c.id}/`}>{data.models.find(m=>m.id===c.model)?.name ?? c.model}</a> · {c.status.replaceAll('_',' ')}</li>)}</ul></section>)}</Frame>
